# Jekyll & Hyde — S1 Technical Level Design
# v0.4: Stevenson acquires new motifs; K2 realizes them.
schema:
  id: JH_AMDD_S1_TECHNICAL_LEVEL_DESIGN
  version: '0.4'
  status: UPDATED_S1_ACQUISITION_K2_REALIZATION
  chapter: S1
  world: STEVENSON
  level_id: L_S1_MOTIF_TUTORIAL_AND_HOUSE
  purpose: Return to Stevenson, sleep once, acquire new motifs through three domestic actions, and write the
    next chapter. New motifs are realized in K2, not in S1.
authority:
  priority:
  - MASTER
  - NARRATIVE_FLOW
  - TECHNICAL_LEVEL_DESIGN
  master_source: JH_MASTER(3).yaml
  narrative_flow_source: JH_Narrative Flow(1).yaml
  previous_contract: 1+2. s0+k1_kontrakt
  conflict_rule: 'Master and Narrative Flow remain authoritative. This draft fills in sequence, action-point,
    motif-resolution and presentation behavior where those documents are level_design_open. A later approved
    decision replaces a draft rule explicitly; it does not silently coexist with it.

    '
  design_principles:
  - S1 is a compact authored interlude, not a second large investigation level.
  - The player selects three domestic actions from six available actions.
  - S1 begins at night; one mandatory sleep transition happens before those actions.
  - After waking, no new laudanum/cocaine use is available in S1.
  - Each action creates exactly one motif candidate; actions do not create six separate story trees.
  - Action combinations never create separate K2 topologies or separate full story versions.
  - Motifs are optional dramatic opportunities, not mandatory quest checkboxes.
  - Each action supports exactly one motif.
  - Exact dialogue, UI copy, VO and cinematic shots are downstream layers.
  - Low Fidelity may simplify presentation but may not remove the three-action structure, the Fanny anchor
    or the writing transition.
  - K1 motif outcomes never select or generate new Stevenson motifs.
  - One morning scene per action; persistent state modulates experience without adding unsupported state branches.
  source_note: Kumulativní kontrakt v3.1 je souhrn možností, nikoli konkrétní průchod. Narrative Flow nebyl
    mezi přílohami této revize; jeho obsah nebyl nově ověřen.
  local_revision_v0_4:
  - Zachováno šest motivů a jedna akce / jeden motiv z S1 v0.3. Master obsahuje širší seznamy motivů na akci;
    zúžení je lokální pravidlo S1 vyžadující synchronizaci masteru.
  - Získání a výběr probíhá v S1; FULFILLED/TWISTED/MISSED až při realizaci v K2. Tato revize výslovně nahrazuje
    předčasné uzavírání motivů z v0.3.
  - Ranní přítomnost Fanny je ustanovení této revize S1, nikoli odvození z jejího odchodu v S0.
  - Pro splnění již deklarované nezávislosti na pořadí se číselné delty akcí sčítají a aplikují jednou při
    konvergenci; prožitek a síla používají společný stav po spánku. Jde o upřesnění S1, nikoli pravidlo převzaté
    z K1 kontraktu.
canonical_contract:
  entry:
    source: K1_TO_S1_TRANSITION
    required:
    - K1 completed successfully
    - Form == JEKYLL
    - ManuscriptDay == 2
    - AuthorPacket and MotifPacket from the prior write lock exist
    - Stevenson state from S0 remains available
  fixed_beats:
  - S1_RETURN_TO_STEVENSON
  - S1_MANUSCRIPT_FEEDBACK
  - S1_SLEEP_TRANSITION
  - S1_WAKE_FOR_MOTIF_ACTIONS
  - S1_FANNY_DOMESTIC_ANCHOR
  - S1_WRITE_NEXT
  action_points: 3
  action_order: no_mechanical_effect
  available_actions:
  - S1_BODY
  - S1_MEDICAL
  - S1_FANNY
  - S1_FIRE
  - S1_WINDOW
  - S1_REST
  exit:
    next: K2
    required:
    - Stevenson writes the next manuscript chapter
    - S1 action-point resolution is committed
    - S1 MotifPacket is generated
  hard_fail:
  - STEVENSON_FATAL if the player commits an actual medication use in S1
  fail_forward:
  - None in the current master; non-fatal action outcomes continue to S1 write.
scope:
  included:
  - Stevenson return and domestic handoff
  - six action choices and three action points
  - motif acquisition, domestic meaning, strength and selection for K2
  - state-dependent manifestation of the same actions
  - Fanny domestic anchor
  - next-chapter write lock and K2 handoff
  excluded:
  - exact house geometry and prop art
  - exact Fanny dialogue and final VO performance
  - final UI design, typography and notification copy
  - new medication system rules
  - new global motif vocabulary outside the actions declared by Master
  - K2 investigation content
entry_state:
  checkpoint: CP_S1_START
  initialize_from:
    Stevenson_state: S0 persistent state after S0_WRITE_LOCK and subsequent canonical transition handling
    K1_world_memory: Rook incident, missing ledger, police/underworld pressure, Crowther pressure and current
      research/motif results
    AuthorPacket: generated at the preceding write lock
    MotifPacket: Historical S0-to-K1 selection and K1 realization results; preserve separately from new S1-to-K2
      candidates.
  fixed_runtime:
    world: STEVENSON
    Form: STEVENSON
    ManuscriptDay: 2
    s1_phase: NIGHT_BEFORE_SLEEP
    action_points_remaining: 0
    S1SleepCommitted: false
    S1AwakeForActions: false
    S1WriteCommitted: false
    S1FatalTriggered: false
  carried_states:
  - Pain
  - Fever
  - Fatigue
  - Agitation
  - SleepDebt
  - Bleed
  - Rebound
  - MedicationDependence
  - AnalgesicTolerance
  - StimulantTolerance
  - FannyBond
  - AuthorPacket
  - MotifPacket
  - ManuscriptFidelity
  - ManuscriptDistortion
  - ManuscriptOverdrive
  - AuthorWeather
  - K1 research tags and current research progress
  - K1 world-memory facts and current pressure values
  - K1 interpretation of the Rook incident
  - current checkpoint and authored time
  lifecycle:
    rule: 'Apply the canonical Stevenson S-entry acute reset exactly once on entry, as defined by stevenson.state_lifecycle.
      Do not reconstruct S0 medication or Fanny writes from their labels.

      '
    acute_reset_source: stevenson.state_lifecycle.acute_effects.reset_at_S_entry
    expected_reset:
      Sedation: 0
      HallucinationSuppression: 0
      StimulantActivation: 0
      ActivationFocusMod: 0
location:
  shell: S1_STEVENSON_HOUSE
  readable_route:
  - STUDY_WRITING_DESK
  - SALON
  - BEDROOM
  - FIREPLACE
  - WINDOW
  - FANNY_ANCHOR
  - MEDICAL_TABLE
  - HOUSE_EXIT
  - SOLDIER_SHELF
  design_rule: 'The player should understand the six available action anchors in one readable domestic space.
    Walking between anchors does not consume action points; selecting an action does.

    '
sleep_and_time:
  entry: 'K1 returns control to Stevenson at night after the K1 manuscript chapter has been completed. S1 does
    not begin with a new medication decision.

    '
  mandatory_transition: S1_SLEEP_TRANSITION
  purpose:
  - close the K1 aftermath night
  - apply the existing SLEEP recovery action
  - move authored time into the morning motif-action window
  - provide a single authored opportunity for dream/manuscript feedback
  recovery_resolver: stevenson.state_lifecycle.recovery_actions.SLEEP
  effects: 'Use the existing resolver''s allowed reductions to Fatigue, SleepDebt, Rebound and Agitation. Exact
    numeric recovery is not invented in this TLD.

    '
  player_behavior:
    before_sleep: 'The player may look and move within the night shell, but cannot spend S1 action points,
      farm rest or take another medication.

      '
    refusal: 'Refusing the bed interaction does not kill Stevenson and does not create a new branch; the morning
      action phase remains locked until sleep is committed.

      '
  after_sleep:
    set:
      s1_phase: MORNING_MOTIF_ACTIONS
      S1SleepCommitted: true
      S1AwakeForActions: true
      action_points_remaining: 3
      FannyPresent: true
    no_second_sleep: true
    presence_rule: S1 establishes Fanny at home in the morning. Do not replay S0 relationship writes or infer
      absence from FannyPostDialogueMode.
  medication_rule: 'S1_MEDICAL is inspection/reflection only. A confirmed actual use of ANALGESIC_A or STIMULANT_S
    routes to the existing S1 STEVENSON_FATAL rule; there is no S1 medication/sleep loop.

    '
morning_possibility_contract:
  basis: S0_to_S1_continuity, S0_summary and K1_success_exit in cumulative contract v3.1; Master state_lifecycle.
  guaranteed:
  - Úspěšný návrat; Stevenson skutečně užil lék v S0.
  - Před akcemi proběhl právě jeden spánek. Žádná varianta sběru motivů bez spánku.
  - Sedation, HallucinationSuppression, StimulantActivation a ActivationFocusMod jsou 0; další dávka není platná
    akce.
  - Šest akcí je ráno dostupných; hráč provede tři různé.
  - K1ResearchGranted je true, ale Jekyllův research journal ani jeho znalosti se nepřevádějí na Stevensonovu
    domácí akci.
  remaining_differences:
    body: Převzít skutečné Pain, Fever, Bleed a další persistentní hodnoty. Spánek není vyléčení nemoci ani
      automatické vynulování únavy.
    recovery: SLEEP smí snížit Fatigue, SleepDebt, Rebound a Agitation. Master neurčuje množství, proto nelze
      tvrdit konkrétní ranní rozsahy či zaručené CLEAR/STABLE.
    medicine: Skutečně podané ANALGESIC_A nebo STIMULANT_S, výsledek dávky a případná Fanny pomoc zůstávají
      kontextem. Akutní účinek se nevrací.
    relationship: Použít skutečný FannyBond a vybranou S0_TRUTH / S0_MINIMIZE / S0_HELP. Všechny tři volby
      byly vztahově pozitivní; MINIMIZE není důkaz nedůvěry. Bez prahů nevytvářet STRAINED/WITHDRAWN větve.
  not_new_motif_inputs:
  - K1RookResolutionStyle
  - K1SelectedInterpretation
  - K1NewspaperRead
  - K1ReliefResolved
  - K1_BrewObservation
  - PoliceHeat
  - UnderworldHeat
  - CrowtherPressure
  - NewcomenSuspicion
  K1_preservation: Tyto výsledky zachovat pro návaznost rukopisu, případný úvodní feedback a K2. Nemění dostupnost,
    identitu ani sílu nového motivu. K1 ÚLEVA=MISSED nezakazuje ÚLEVU v S1 a nová ÚLEVA starý výsledek nepřepisuje.
  packet_timing: Starý AuthorPacket je historický otisk pro K1. Ranní domácí prožitek vychází ze současného
    stavu po resetu a spánku. Nový AuthorPacket se vytvoří z aktuálního stavu při S1_WRITE_NEXT a ovlivní K2.
  variation_budget: Jedno základní provedení na akci. Níže uvedené kontexty mění akcent či gesto, nejsou další
    volby, motivy nebo povinné kombinatorické scény.
state_model:
  action_points:
    initial: 3
    spend: 1 per completed S1 action
    rule: Choose three distinct actions; repeating an action is disabled.
    order_matters: false
    order_effect: Use the same post-sleep state as the baseline for all candidate presentation/strength evaluation.
      Accumulate declared action deltas and apply their sum once, with canonical bounds, at convergence. This
      avoids order-dependent clamping. Current final state generates the new AuthorPacket.
  action_history:
    required_fields:
    - action_id
    - selection_order
    - state_snapshot_at_selection
    - applied_state_writes
    - generated_motif_evidence
    rule: Design description only; reuse checkpoint state and selected action set. No new per-line logs or
      save serialization requirement.
  chapter_flags:
  - S1ActionCount
  - S1ActionPointsRemaining
  - S1WriteCommitted
  - S1NextChapterReady
  - S1FatalTriggered
  - S1FannyAnchorVisited
  - S1MotifConvergenceResolved
  - S1ManuscriptFeedbackPresented
  - S1SelectedAction_1
  - S1SelectedAction_2
  - S1SelectedAction_3
  - S1ActionOrder
  - S1MotifEvidenceSet
  - S1SelectedMotifSet
  - LeadSoldierShelfSeen
  - LeadSoldierQuestAccepted
motif_model:
  purpose: 'Convert the three chosen domestic actions into exactly three authored motif candidates for the
    next manuscript chapter. One completed action creates one motif candidate; S1 does not ask the player to
    complete every possible motif.

    '
  states:
  - UNSEEN
  - CANDIDATE
  - ACTIVE
  - DISCARDED
  strength_range: 0..100
  candidate_creation: 'Each completed action creates exactly one candidate for its declared motif. No action
    emits a list of motifs and no later action duplicates or strengthens an already-created motif.

    '
  state_gating: All six actions are available in the morning; phase, unused action and remaining AP are the
    only selection gates.
  fading: No passive decay in S1. Unselected candidates become DISCARDED, not MISSED.
  convergence: After three actions, rank their candidates, select the strongest two and a third if third.Strength
    >= second.Strength - 10. Mark selected candidates ACTIVE for K2 and others DISCARDED. S1 never assigns
    FULFILLED, TWISTED or MISSED to these new motifs.
  topology_compression:
    K2_topologies_from_S1: 1
    K2_branching_rule: 'S1 motif identity may affect writing tone, optional authored expression or quality
      inputs only. It does not create a separate K2 mission, location graph or investigation branch.

      '
  player_visibility: Show the domestic experience and acquired theme. Final writing presents selected themes,
    not their K2 realization or hidden numeric strength.
  candidate_catalog:
    TELO:
      source_action: S1_BODY
      display_name: TĚLO
      meaning: Tělo jako nositel schopností, omezení a poznatelných stop.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id001
      - Pain
      - Fever
      - Bleed
      - Fatigue
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
    VĚDA:
      source_action: S1_MEDICAL
      display_name: VĚDA
      meaning: Pozorování, metoda a ověřování předpokladu.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id002
      - Pain
      - MedicationDependence
      - AnalgesicTolerance
      - StimulantTolerance
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
    DŮVĚRA:
      source_action: S1_FANNY
      display_name: DŮVĚRA
      meaning: Dovolit druhému člověku přístup k části pravdy a spolehnout se na něj.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id003
      - FannyBond
      - Agitation
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
    VZPOMÍNKA:
      source_action: S1_FIRE
      display_name: VZPOMÍNKA
      meaning: Minulá zkušenost se vrací jako uchovaný detail a dostává význam v přítomnosti.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id004
      - Agitation
      - Fatigue
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
    SLEDOVÁNÍ:
      source_action: S1_WINDOW
      display_name: SLEDOVÁNÍ
      meaning: Pozorovatel, pozorovaný a hranice toho, co lze z pohledu poznat.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id005
      - Agitation
      - Pain
      - Fatigue
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
    ÚLEVA:
      source_action: S1_REST
      display_name: ÚLEVA
      meaning: Dočasné polevení zátěže bez odstranění její příčiny.
      availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
      experience_inputs: &id006
      - Pain
      - Fatigue
      - Agitation
      - SleepDebt
      - Rebound
      created_state: CANDIDATE
      selected_state: ACTIVE
      realization_chapter: K2
  naming_rule: 'Motif IDs use the existing master vocabulary where it exists. Diacritics in content text are
    presentation; implementation IDs should use stable ASCII IDs if the project coding standard requires it
    (e.g. Telo, Veda, Pece).

    '
  realization_in_K2:
    outcomes:
    - FULFILLED
    - TWISTED
    - MISSED
    rule: Selected motifs enter K2 ACTIVE and unresolved. K2 authored opportunities determine fulfillment or
      twisting; selected unresolved motifs become MISSED at K2 closure. Acquisition, domestic presentation
      and selection in S1 award no realization score.
  strength_policy:
    inputs: Selected action and shared post-sleep Stevenson baseline only; no K1 outcomes or historical packet.
    numeric_status: 'TUNING: weights and deterministic tie-break are not supplied by the contract; do not invent
      their values or treat this draft as a completed numeric resolver.'
    order: Action order cannot break ties or modify strength.
    state_role: Persistent body/relationship state can affect experienced emphasis and eventual tuned strength.
      Motif identity remains fixed; no extra motif is emitted.
action_catalog:
  S1_BODY:
    intent: Prohlédnout vlastní tělo a všimnout si jeho současných mezí.
    anchor: BEDROOM
    motif: TELO
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    cost: 1 action point
    writes:
      Fatigue: 3
    creates_evidence: TELO
    expression:
      morning_beat: Po probuzení se Stevenson posadí, protáhne ruku a sleduje námahu při obyčejném pohybu.
        Tělo je něco, co může pozorovat, ale ne libovolně ovládat.
      allowed_context: Bolest či horečka mění provedení pohybu podle skutečného stavu. Krvácení nezobrazovat,
        pokud Bleed není přítomné. Nezískává Hydeovu ránu ani jeho odolnost.
      motif_acquired: Tělo jako nositel schopností, omezení a poznatelných stop.
      state_inputs: *id001
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
  S1_MEDICAL:
    intent: Prohlédnout vlastní léky a poznámky bez užití dávky.
    anchor: MEDICAL_TABLE
    motif: VĚDA
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    cost: 1 action point
    writes: {}
    creates_evidence: VĚDA
    guard: 'The player may inspect, compare notes and prepare writing material. No actual medication-use interaction
      is offered after waking. If an implementation exposes a debug/legacy use path, it routes to STEVENSON_FATAL
      through the master S1 hard-fail rule.

      '
    expression:
      morning_beat: Stevenson vezme do ruky lahvičku nebo vlastní záznam a porovná očekávaný účinek s tím,
        co sám zažil. Oddělí pozorování od domněnky.
      allowed_context: Podle skutečného léku v S0 připomene tlumení bolesti nebo snahu získat sílu k práci.
        Při podání Fanny může uznat její pomoc. Výsledek dávky je kontext, nikoli znovu aktivovaný účinek;
        žádný K1 recept ani výzkumný bonus.
      motif_acquired: Pozorování, metoda a ověřování předpokladu.
      state_inputs: *id002
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
  S1_FANNY:
    intent: Přijmout ranní přítomnost Fanny a krátce s ní sdílet vlastní stav.
    anchor: FANNY_ANCHOR
    motif: DŮVĚRA
    cost: 1 action point
    writes: {}
    creates_evidence: DŮVĚRA
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    expression:
      morning_beat: Fanny se zajímá o jeho ráno. Stevenson jí věnuje pozornost a připustí ji k vlastní zkušenosti,
        aniž musí předat celý rukopis.
      allowed_context: 'S0_TRUTH: naváže na otevřenost. S0_MINIMIZE: naváže na dřívější uklidnění bez automatického
        obvinění ze lži. S0_HELP: naváže na přijatou pomoc. Jde o zabarvení jedné interakce, ne tři nové vztahové
        volby.'
      motif_acquired: Dovolit druhému člověku přístup k části pravdy a spolehnout se na něj.
      state_inputs: *id003
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
  S1_FIRE:
    intent: Zastavit se u krbu a vybavit si vlastní předchozí večer.
    anchor: FIREPLACE
    motif: VZPOMÍNKA
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    cost: 1 action point
    writes:
      Agitation: -5
    creates_evidence: VZPOMÍNKA
    expression:
      morning_beat: 'Teplo a praskání ohně připomenou Stevensonovi chvíli předchozího večera v domě: tělesný
        pocit, podaný lék či Fannyinu přítomnost. Všimne si, co ze zážitku v paměti zůstalo.'
      allowed_context: Použít jen skutečně prožitou domácí událost ze S0. Nevymýšlet novou biografickou scénu.
        Motiv není odměna za K1 styl boje ani reprodukce Rookovy smrti.
      motif_acquired: Minulá zkušenost se vrací jako uchovaný detail a dostává význam v přítomnosti.
      state_inputs: *id004
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
  S1_WINDOW:
    intent: Chvíli pozorovat prostor před domem.
    anchor: WINDOW
    motif: SLEDOVÁNÍ
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    cost: 1 action point
    writes: {}
    creates_evidence: SLEDOVÁNÍ
    expression:
      morning_beat: Stevenson zůstane u okna a sleduje obyčejný pohyb venku. Uvědomí si rozdíl mezi tím, co
        vidí, a tím, co o pozorovaném člověku skutečně ví.
      allowed_context: Výchozí motiv je pozorování. Přetrvávající neklid může změnit soustředění či gesto,
        ale nezakládá druhou paranoidní větev ani skutečného pronásledovatele. K1 PoliceHeat není tlak policie
        na Stevensonův dům.
      motif_acquired: Pozorovatel, pozorovaný a hranice toho, co lze z pohledu poznat.
      state_inputs: *id005
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
  S1_REST:
    intent: Krátce odpočívat před prací, nikoli znovu usnout.
    anchor: BEDROOM
    motif: ÚLEVA
    availability: ALWAYS_IN_S1_ACTION_WINDOW
    cost: 1 action point
    writes:
      Fatigue: -12
      Agitation: -5
    creates_evidence: ÚLEVA
    expression:
      morning_beat: Stevenson se pohodlně usadí, přestane se namáhat a na chvíli odloží požadavek pokračovat
        v práci. Prožije odlehčení nebo zachování klidu, i když nemoc trvá.
      allowed_context: Při zbývající únavě či neklidu je patrná změna; při nízkých hodnotách jde o uchování
        klidu. Nevynucovat předchozí vyčerpání, nový lék ani snížení Pain. K1 noviny či morální interpretace
        tuto akci nepodmiňují.
      motif_acquired: Dočasné polevení zátěže bez odstranění její příčiny.
      state_inputs: *id006
      state_baseline: post-sleep Stevenson state; not the historical K1 AuthorPacket
    no_new_branch: true
    writes_timing: Queue once on completion; aggregate selected action deltas at convergence.
availability_and_state_expression:
  all_actions_available: true
  rule: After waking, all six anchors are selectable once, while AP remain. Each creates one fixed motif candidate.
    No K1 result gates a domestic action.
  current_state: Use morning_possibility_contract and per-action expression. Avoid unsupported high/low branch
    thresholds.
  historical_AuthorPacket: Only historical K1 presentation/feedback context; never substitute it for current
    Stevenson state or new motif strength.
  new_AuthorPacket: Generate at S1 write lock using canonical derived values from final Stevenson state. Fidelity,
    Distortion, Overdrive, CognitionBand and AuthorWeather affect K2 through canonical rules.
  feedback_limit: Optional K1 return feedback does not generate motifs, transfer police pressure into domestic
    state or add undeclared state writes.
sequence:
- id: S1_BOOT
  type: SYSTEM
  player_control: false
  actions:
  - validate K1 transition and inherited packet
  - apply Stevenson S-entry acute reset once
  - initialize S1 action points to 0; morning actions locked
  - create CP_S1_START
  exit: S1_RETURN_TO_STEVENSON
- id: S1_RETURN_TO_STEVENSON
  type: CHAPTER_RETURN
  player_control: locked_then_handoff
  purpose:
  - return from manuscript space to Stevenson
  - show that K1 material remains available as memory and pressure
  - establish the domestic house shell
  actions:
  - allow night-shell movement; keep motif interactions locked
  exit: S1_MANUSCRIPT_FEEDBACK
- id: S1_MANUSCRIPT_FEEDBACK
  type: PRESENTATION_GAMEPLAY_BEAT
  player_control: limited_then_free
  purpose: 'Give the player a readable expression of manuscript feedback without declaring a single correct
    interpretation of K1.

    '
  actions:
  - present one state-appropriate authored feedback cue
  - do not resolve a new motif solely from the cue
  - do not create a new objective from optional atmosphere
  - set S1ManuscriptFeedbackPresented = true after feedback
  exit: S1_SLEEP_TRANSITION
- id: S1_SLEEP_TRANSITION
  type: MANDATORY_RECOVERY_TRANSITION
  player_control: true
  preconditions:
  - S1ManuscriptFeedbackPresented == true
  - S1SleepCommitted == false
  - s1_phase == NIGHT_BEFORE_SLEEP
  actions:
  - require the player to choose the bed/sleep interaction
  - call stevenson.state_lifecycle.recovery_actions.SLEEP
  - advance authored time through one authored night-to-morning transition
  - set S1SleepCommitted = true
  - set S1AwakeForActions = true
  - set s1_phase = MORNING_MOTIF_ACTIONS
  - set S1ActionPointsRemaining = 3
  - optionally fire one authored dream/manuscript feedback presentation
  - establish FannyPresent = true for this morning without relationship writes
  - retain post-sleep baseline through existing checkpoint state
  - create CP_S1_AWAKE
  exit: S1_WAKE_FOR_MOTIF_ACTIONS
- id: S1_WAKE_FOR_MOTIF_ACTIONS
  type: MORNING_HANDOFF
  player_control: locked_then_handoff
  actions:
  - present Stevenson awake after the mandatory sleep transition
  - show current body-state feedback without exposing hidden motif weights
  - enable the six domestic action anchors
  exit: S1_ACTION_SELECTION
- id: S1_ACTION_SELECTION
  type: ACTION_POINT_FREE_EXPLORATION
  player_control: true
  preconditions:
  - S1AwakeForActions == true
  - S1ActionPointsRemaining > 0
  actions:
  - allow movement among six anchors
  - on each distinct completed action spend one point and record its selection
  - queue declared state deltas once; use common post-sleep baseline for motif experience
  - create the action's one CANDIDATE
  - return while points remain; at zero go to S1_MOTIF_CONVERGENCE
  exit_when: S1ActionPointsRemaining == 0
- id: S1_MOTIF_CONVERGENCE
  type: SYSTEM_RESOLUTION
  player_control: false
  actions:
  - apply sum of selected action state deltas once to post-sleep baseline using canonical bounds
  - rank three candidates without action order; numeric strength and tie-break remain tuning
  - select strongest two and third only if third.Strength >= second.Strength - 10
  - mark selected candidates ACTIVE, unselected DISCARDED; no K2 realization outcome yet
  - set S1MotifConvergenceResolved = true
  - create CP_S1_PRE_WRITE
  exit: S1_FANNY_DOMESTIC_ANCHOR
- id: S1_FANNY_DOMESTIC_ANCHOR
  type: NARRATIVE_ANCHOR
  player_control: limited_then_free
  purpose: 'Confirm Fanny and the household remain emotionally present after the selected actions. This is
    not a second action point and does not add a hidden relationship choice.

    '
  actions:
  - allow one short contextual exchange or reaction
  - acknowledge selected themes without realizing them
  - no additional candidate or FannyBond write
  exit: S1_WRITE_NEXT_PROMPT
- id: S1_WRITE_NEXT_PROMPT
  type: GATE
  player_control: true
  preconditions:
  - S1ActionPointsRemaining == 0
  - S1MotifConvergenceResolved == true
  actions:
  - enable writing desk
  - show the next-chapter writing objective
  exit_on_write: S1_WRITE_NEXT
- id: S1_WRITE_NEXT
  type: SYSTEM_LOCK
  player_control: false
  actions:
  - set S1WriteCommitted = true
  - generate new AuthorPacket from final current Stevenson state via canonical derived values
  - commit S1 MotifPacket with selected ACTIVE motifs for K2
  - do not assign K2 MotifClosure before realization in K2
  - persist selected actions, candidate selection and current state
  - create CP_S1_COMPLETE
  - clear acute effects after write lock under canonical lifecycle
  exit: S1_TO_K2_TRANSITION
- id: S1_TO_K2_TRANSITION
  type: CHAPTER_TRANSITION
  player_control: false
  actions:
  - pass current Stevenson state and new AuthorPacket/MotifPacket to K2
  - preserve K1 world memory and pressure
  - load K2 with Form == JEKYLL, SerumStock == 0 and TransformWindow == CLOSED
  next: K2
objectives:
  OBJ_LEAD_SOLDIERS:
    active_after: LeadSoldierQuestAccepted == true
    complete_when: StevensonSoldiersFoundCount == 16
    display_intent: FIND_STEVENSON_LEAD_SOLDIERS
    optional: true
    rule: Count shown in the quest log only. No HUD element, no waypoint, no location text.
interaction_catalog:
  INT_S1_WRITING_DESK:
    zone: STUDY_WRITING_DESK
    enabled_when: S1ActionPointsRemaining == 0 AND S1MotifConvergenceResolved == true
    action: COMMIT_NEXT_MANUSCRIPT_CHAPTER
    time_cost: authored downstream; no number set in v0.4
  INT_S1_MEDICATION_INSPECT:
    zone: MEDICAL_TABLE
    enabled_when: S1 action selection is active AND S1AwakeForActions == true
    action: INSPECT_MEDICINE_AND_NOTES
    result: S1_MEDICAL evidence only
    rule: 'This interaction is not medication use. A confirmed actual dose routes to STEVENSON_FATAL according
      to the master S1 hard-fail rule.

      '
  INT_S1_FANNY_ANCHOR:
    zone: FANNY_ANCHOR
    action: SELECT_S1_FANNY
    result: S1_FANNY action and its declared motif evidence
  INT_S1_BODY_ANCHOR:
    zone: BEDROOM
    action: SELECT_S1_BODY
    result: S1_BODY action and its declared motif evidence
  INT_S1_REST_ANCHOR:
    zone: BEDROOM
    action: SELECT_S1_REST
    result: S1_REST action and its declared motif evidence
  INT_S1_FIREPLACE:
    zone: FIREPLACE
    action: SELECT_S1_FIRE
    result: S1_FIRE action and its declared motif evidence
  INT_S1_WINDOW:
    zone: WINDOW
    action: SELECT_S1_WINDOW
    result: S1_WINDOW action and its declared motif evidence
  INT_S1_SOLDIER_SHELF:
    zone: SOLDIER_SHELF
    optional: true
    enabled_when: S1ManuscriptFeedbackPresented == true AND S1WriteCommitted == false
    action: INSPECT_SOLDIER_SHELF
    result: >
      Show sixteen figures. Figures already in FoundStevensonSoldiers show a subtly
      changed state; the inspect text shows the count (for example 1/16). Set
      LeadSoldierShelfSeen=true. Offer ACCEPT_COLLECTING or NOT_NOW.
    choices:
      ACCEPT_COLLECTING: set LeadSoldierQuestAccepted=true; activate OBJ_LEAD_SOLDIERS
      NOT_NOW: no writes; the shelf stays interactable and the offer returns on re-inspection
    rule: >
      Spends no action point and no activity, grants no motif, and never blocks S1.
      The quest is never granted automatically. The shelf remains available in later
      Stevenson chapters (MASTER_CHANGE_PROPOSED).
hard_fail_handling:
  STEVENSON_FATAL:
    trigger: confirmed actual medication use during S1
    result: terminal failure; reload last valid S1 checkpoint
    checkpoint: Latest valid S1 checkpoint, including CP_S1_AWAKE; never commit a successful packet from a
      fatal attempt.
    no_partial_success: true
  rule: 'Inspecting medicine, remembering medicine or discussing medicine is not medication use and must not
    trigger the hard fail.

    '
checkpoints:
  CP_S1_START:
    created_at: S1_BOOT
    purpose: retry the night return and mandatory sleep from a clean inherited state
    restores:
    - inherited Stevenson state
    - K1 AuthorPacket/MotifPacket
    - s1_phase: NIGHT_BEFORE_SLEEP
    - S1SleepCommitted: false
    - S1AwakeForActions: false
    - action_points_remaining: 0
    - no S1 action history
    - no S1 motif convergence
  CP_S1_AWAKE:
    created_at: S1_SLEEP_TRANSITION
    purpose: retry the three-action motif window without replaying sleep
    restores:
    - current Stevenson state after SLEEP recovery
    - S1SleepCommitted: true
    - S1AwakeForActions: true
    - s1_phase: MORNING_MOTIF_ACTIONS
    - action_points_remaining: 3
    - no S1 action history
    - no S1 motif convergence
  CP_S1_PRE_WRITE:
    created_at: S1_MOTIF_CONVERGENCE
    purpose: retry the final domestic anchor or writing transition without replaying the three actions
    restores:
    - all three selected actions, candidate evidence and ACTIVE/DISCARDED selection
    - current Stevenson state after action writes
    - S1MotifConvergenceResolved: true
  CP_S1_COMPLETE:
    created_at: S1_WRITE_NEXT
    purpose: enter K2 without replaying S1
    restores:
    - current Stevenson state
    - S1 MotifPacket and AuthorPacket
    - S1 action summary
    - S1 selected ACTIVE motifs; K2 realization unresolved
    - K1 world memory and pressure
save_and_idempotency:
  source: S1 checkpoints and existing save contract pattern
  rules:
  - Loading a checkpoint reconstructs the selected action set; it does not spend points or replay sleep recovery
    again.
  - Candidate selection and aggregate action state writes run once per S1 attempt; loading does not repeat
    them.
  - S1 write lock runs once; K2 receives one S1 packet.
  - A failed attempt does not create a successful S1 output.
  implementation_status: DESIGN_CONTRACT_ONLY_CPP_SAVE_IMPLEMENTATION_DEFERRED
dialogue_and_presentation_contract:
  dialogue_intents:
  - S1_RETURN_TO_STEVENSON: Stevenson recognizes that the manuscript has changed how he sees his body and house.
  - S1_MANUSCRIPT_FEEDBACK: The written world is available as pressure/material, not as a literal speaking
      voice by default.
  - S1_FANNY_DOMESTIC_ANCHOR: Fanny remains present as a real relationship, not merely a motif selector.
  - S1_WRITE_NEXT: Stevenson commits to continuing the manuscript.
  exact_lines: TBD_IN_DIALOGUE_LAYER
  voiced: Decide with final dialogue/VO pass; absence of VO does not alter mechanics.
  notifications: 'Optional action-complete feedback may say that a new thought or motif has entered the manuscript.
    Exact copy, sound, icon and duration are downstream.

    '
  UI_rules:
  - Never display hidden motif strength or the strongest-two formula.
  - Show three remaining action points after waking in a readable but non-intrusive way.
  - Do not present the six actions as mandatory objectives.
  - Actual medication use must have a clear interaction distinction from inspection.
  - Do not show a usable post-wake dose prompt in S1.
K2_handoff:
  fixed:
    world: MANUSCRIPT
    Form: JEKYLL
    SerumStock: 0
    TransformWindow: CLOSED
  inherited_from_S1:
  - current Stevenson persistent state
  - S1 selected ACTIVE motifs, domestic meaning and strength; realization unresolved
  - S1 AuthorPacket and MotifPacket
  - S0 and K1 world memory
  - PoliceHeat
  - UnderworldHeat
  - CrowtherPressure
  - NewcomenSuspicion
  - FannyBond
  - research tags and current ResearchProgress
  - K1 selected interpretation
  - S1 authoring inputs; K2 MotifClosure deferred until K2 realization
  K2_does_not_receive_as_new_topology:
  - a separate branch for each exact S1 dialogue line
  - a branch for each order-specific presentation variation unless a future TLD explicitly promotes it
  - a new serum dose from S1
  rule: K2 continues after the completed first Newcomen consultation. Preserve RookDead, LedgerMissing, green-blood
    evidence, actual pressures and K1 interpretation including NONE. New S1 motifs offer realization opportunities
    within the shared investigation topology; do not replay first discoveries or repair old MISSED outcomes.
acceptance_tests:
- S1 always returns to Stevenson after a successful K1.
- S1 begins in the night-before-sleep phase with zero available motif action points.
- The player must commit one sleep transition before the morning motif-action phase unlocks.
- Sleep uses the existing SLEEP recovery resolver and is applied exactly once.
- Refusing to sleep does not kill Stevenson and does not unlock motif actions.
- S1 exposes exactly six declared actions and gives exactly three action points.
- No action can be selected twice in v0.4.
- Selection order does not change state writes, motif selection or K2 topology.
- S1_BODY applies Fatigue +3 exactly once at convergence if selected.
- S1_FIRE applies Agitation -5 exactly once at convergence if selected.
- S1_REST applies Fatigue -12 and Agitation -5 exactly once at convergence if selected.
- S1_MEDICAL inspection never counts as actual medication use.
- No post-wake laudanum/cocaine dose is offered as a valid S1 action.
- Actual S1 medication use routes to STEVENSON_FATAL.
- Every selected action creates only its one declared motif evidence.
- No passive motif decay occurs while the player walks or waits in S1.
- Convergence selects the strongest two candidates and an optional third under the master threshold.
- Low Fidelity does not remove the three-action structure or writing transition.
- S1 write lock generates one packet and transitions to K2.
- K2 starts Jekyll, with SerumStock 0 and TransformWindow CLOSED.
- Every valid S1 action combination reaches the same K2 main topology.
- Reloading CP_S1_PRE_WRITE does not replay action writes or repeat candidate selection.
- Every valid successful K1 entry exposes all six morning actions; actual medication remains forbidden.
- Different K1 combat, brew, newspaper or suspicion results do not select or gate new S1 motifs.
- No-sleep, renewed acute medication effects, invented Fanny estrangement and a guaranteed healthy morning
  are not S1 branches.
- Old AuthorPacket remains historical; current post-sleep state informs experience and new final state generates
  the K2 packet.
- New motifs leave S1 ACTIVE or DISCARDED; no new FULFILLED/TWISTED/MISSED is assigned in S1.
- S1 REST can acquire new ULEVA even when K1 ULEVA is MISSED, without changing the old outcome.
- All permutations of the same selected actions use one post-sleep baseline and the same summed deltas with
  one clamp.
- Fanny is present by S1 morning staging, independent of S0 historical post-dialogue position.
- S1 can be completed without ever inspecting the soldier shelf.
- Inspecting the shelf or accepting the quest spends no action point or activity and creates no motif.
- With RLS_SOLDIER_01_ROOK already held the first inspect shows 1/16; otherwise 0/16.
- Declining leaves LeadSoldierQuestAccepted == false and the offer returns on re-inspection.
- The shelf is still interactable in S2 if skipped in S1.
