- id: S1_SLEEP_PRESENTATION
  question: Exact sleep animation, dream cue and morning transition.
  current_proposal: One authored transition; no additional gameplay branch.
- id: S1_MOTIF_STRENGTH
  question: Numeric acquisition strength weights and order-independent tie-break.
  current_proposal: TUNING; source defines two strongest and optional third within 10 only. Do not invent a
    completed resolver.
- id: S1_FANNY_DIALOGUE
  question: Exact relationship exchange and whether it has any numeric FannyBond effect.
  current_proposal: No new FannyBond write; contextualize the single interaction using actual S0 choice and
    current bond.
- id: S1_MEDICATION_PRESENTATION
  question: Whether the medical table shows bottles, notes or an empty/locked presentation.
  current_proposal: Inspection/reflection is available; no post-wake dose prompt is a valid S1 action.
- id: S1_MANUSCRIPT_FEEDBACK
  question: Exact visual/audio manifestation of K1 feedback.
  current_proposal: One authored cue reacts to inherited AuthorPacket and K1 outcomes without creating a new
    branch.
- id: S1_WRITE_QUALITY
  question: Numeric authoring-quality inputs at S1 write lock.
  current_proposal: Use canonical authoring rules; K2 MotifClosure is evaluated only after K2 realization,
    not in S1.
- id: S1_TIME
  question: Exact authored minutes for sleep and the three morning actions.
  current_proposal: Use one mandatory sleep transition plus three one-point actions; exact minute values remain
